stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "有效" as validTicket
    state "已验票" as usedTicket
    state "已失效" as invalidTicket

    [*] --> validTicket : 支付成功并出票
    validTicket --> usedTicket : 有效账号在授权窗口内确认验票
    validTicket --> invalidTicket : 成功退款或正常结束未签到
    usedTicket --> usedTicket : 仍有权限时重复查询，仅返回首次签到结果
    invalidTicket --> invalidTicket : 查询失效原因，不允许验票
